  "projects": [
   {
    "title": "Tag Recommendation for URLS",
    "description": "Social networking sites such as delicious, Flickr and many more introduce us to the concept of social bookmarking, or tagging. Tagging helps users organize and share digital content. Tagged data is becoming abundant over the Internet and it also helps search engines optimize their searches. However, many resources on the web still lack tag information. Our project addresses this issue. We implemented a recommendation system using R that recommends appropriate tags for URLs based on a known set of URLs with user assigned social bookmarking tags. ",
